---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";

import imgMe from "@/images/me-with-bg.png";
import H2 from "@/components/ui/h2.astro";
---

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 pt-0 lg:pt-10">
    <Picture
      formats={["webp", "png"]}
      src={imgMe}
      class="border-foreground shadow-foreground/5 h-80 rounded-xl border-2 object-cover shadow-lg"
      alt="An Illustration of Emre Can in ghibli style"
    />
    <p class="text-foreground/30 px-2 text-end">Made by my sister, Nisa</p>
  </div>
  <div class="space-y-6 py-4">
    <H2 class="text-shadow-foreground/5 text-shadow-lg">introduction</H2>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <p class="text-pretty">
        Hey! I'm Emre, a curious software developer mainly focused on web, but I have also worked on
        desktop apps and have experience in system programming.
      </p>
      <p class="text-pretty">
        I don't just build endpoints. I've taken projects from ground to production, handling UI/UX,
        database design, architecture, security, and performance along the way. I believe I have
        reached the point where I am confident enough to do anything given enough time.
      </p>
      <p class="text-pretty">
        I like to poke around things and ask "why" until my curiosity is tamed enough. Bending
        rules, questioning assumptions, rejecting old ways for the sake of something better.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
